{
  "id": 101551252,
  "iid": 3152,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "dfilter: Fix handling of escaped quotes in macros",
  "description": "We can't unescape characters when constructing the macro\nprivate data structures, parts splitting in this case. The\nescaping must be preserved until after the macro is expanded\nand until just before it is evaluated in the display filter\nengine, otherwise it will likely generate a syntax error in\nthe parser.\n\nIn the macro body we allow '$' (or any other char) to be escaped\nwith backslash.\n\nFixes #17160.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2021-05-26T14:07:51.420Z",
  "updated_at": "2021-05-28T10:56:17.773Z",
